397 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 259 0 R
/E (This report establishes a data-driven framework to identify undervalued forwards across Major and Secondary leagues. Integrating performance metrics from FBref and valuations from Transfermarkt, we applied Principal Component Factoring \(PCF\) and Cluster Analysis to categorize players into distinct tactical profiles based on three extracted dimensions: Playmaking & Workrate, Pure Finishing Threat, and Error Proneness. The analysis revealed structural differences between ecosystems, identifying "Complete Finishers" as an elite commodity in Major Leagues, whereas Secondary Leagues are dominated by mediocrity or dominant "Alien" profiles. By benchmarking market values against cluster-specific medians, we successfully identified multiple "hidden bargains", elite performers priced significantly below their peer group, such as Franck Honorat and Mohamed Nassoh. The study concludes that combining statistical profiling with financial analysis offers clubs a scalable, evidence-based strategy to exploit market inefficiencies and mitigate recruitment risk.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
