/P 290 0 R
/E (To transition from statistical clustering to actionable transfer targets, we developed a robust selection framework designed to identify true market inefficiencies. Our "Moneyball" algorithm is built on three pillars:)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
768 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 290 0 R
/E (Quality Criterion: The primary filter was performance, not price. We did not simply look for the cheapest players; we searched for Elite players who happen to be undervalued. A player was only considered for selection if their Factor Scores exceeded the performance average of their specific cluster \(e.g., a "Safe Playmaker" must have a Playmaking Score > 1.0 and Error Proneness < -1.0\).)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
