/P 300 0 R
/E (The results of our analysis reveal clear and interpretable patterns in forward profiles across both major and secondary leagues. By applying Principal Component Factoring \(PCF\) with Varimax rotation, we successfully compressed a large set of performance indicators into three meaningful components, Playmaking & Workrate, Pure Finishing Threat, and Error Proneness, which captured the essential behavioral differences between attacking players. The rotated structure allowed us to clearly distinguish wingers, who typically display high involvement and creation, from strikers, who cluster around direct finishing actions.)
/Pg 55 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
