/Title (An analysis of the summary statistics \(Fig. 4\) reveals significant variance in metrics such as Shot-Creating Actions \(SCA\), Progressive Carries \(PrgC\), and Aerial Duels Won \(AeWon\). These high-variance variables proved to be crucial differentiators in our subsequent analysis, effectively distinguishing between player archetypes such as "Playmakers" \(high SCA/PrgC and negative AeWon\) and "Finishing Threats" \(low PrgC/SCA and positive AeWon\).)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2988 0 R
/Prev 2994 0 R
>>
endobj
